              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wewe mwana w'omuntu, gambira omulemi wa Taya oti, MUKAMA Ruhanga naagamba ati: Habw'okwekuza kwawe okuhinguraine, okagamba oti: Ninyowe ruhanga anyakusinga ha kitebe kya baaruhanga, hagati y'enyanja; nangwa, oli muntu toli Ruhanga, noobu oraaba nooyerora oli w'amagezi nka Ruhanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
